# Snap list: flings of different strengths must rest on a row edge, forwards and back.
route Snap
latency 0,0
wait 3
mark short-fling
pan 200 700 0 -300 120
wait 2
mark long-fling
pan 200 750 0 -650 100
wait 2.5
mark slow-drag-release
pan 200 700 0 -250 1500
wait 2
mark back-fling
pan 200 200 0 500 100
wait 2.5
mark tiny-nudge
pan 200 600 0 -40 400
wait 2
mark stt
statusbar
wait 2.5
